"无法启动全局键盘与点击监听。请退出并重新打开 Keyboard 后再试。" = "Couldn't start global keyboard and click monitoring. Quit and reopen Keyboard, then try again.";
"请先把 Keyboard 移到“应用程序”文件夹，再打开应用完成自动登记。" = "Move Keyboard to Applications first, then reopen it to finish setup.";
"音色包不会被永久删除，可从 Keyboard 音色目录的 .Trash 中恢复。" = "Sound packs are not permanently deleted. You can restore them from .Trash in the Keyboard sound-pack folder.";
"备用音频转换失败；系统也无法解码此格式，请改用 WAV、AIFF、CAF 或 M4A。" = "Fallback audio conversion failed, and the system also cannot decode this format. Please use WAV, AIFF, CAF, or M4A.";
"自动请求至少间隔 5 分钟，手动检查至少间隔 65 秒；不会上传按键、输入内容或音色设置。" = "Automatic checks are spaced at least 5 minutes apart, and manual checks at least 65 seconds apart. No key events, typed content, or sound-pack settings are uploaded.";
"按下计数包含 Shift、Command、回车、退格和方向键；长按产生的系统自动重复不增加物理按下次数。" = "Counts include Shift, Command, Return, Delete, and arrow keys. System key repeat does not increase physical key-press counts.";
"Keyboard 使用按键编号播放声音，并可在你主动开启后于本机统计字符数量、物理按键次数和前台应用；不读取或保存文字、点击位置或输入内容。" = "Keyboard uses key codes to play sounds. If you turn stats on, it stores character counts, physical key presses, and the frontmost app locally on this Mac. It does not read or save typed text, click locations, or input content.";
"如果系统开关已经打开但这里仍显示等待，请选中旧的 Zisla 条目，点列表下方“−”删除，再重新添加 /Applications/Zisla.app。完成后退出并重新打开应用。" = "If Input Monitoring is already enabled but Zisla still shows waiting, remove the old Zisla entry with the “−” button, then add /Applications/Zisla.app again. After that, quit and reopen the app.";

